.task-board/EPIC-260715-2lz67t_udp-relay-and-degraded-mode/STORY-260715-1nsw9p_udp-forwarding-and-associations/TASK-260715-28jdml_integrate-full-mode-dns-over-relay/progress.md:28:- [ ] Prove bounded priority and zero query content or physical resolver fallback
