.task-board/EPIC-260716-3fyjn0_manual-validation-and-approvals/STORY-260716-2m2tl1_m0-viability-manual-gates/TASK-260715-1kntdx_verify-p0-on-physical-iphone/README.md:7:In scope: named physical iPhone and current supported iOS release; development install; trust and VPN approval steps; configuration save and reload; start, provider message, stop, host termination, uninstall and reinstall where relevant; entitlement and device-log correlation; repeated lifecycle loops. Out of scope: simulator-only evidence, packet forwarding, performance or memory gates, TestFlight, App Store review, and collecting unrelated personal device logs.
