.task-board/EPIC-260716-3fyjn0_manual-validation-and-approvals/STORY-260716-d37sts_m1-physical-validation/TASK-260715-3f4rhy_verify-physical-provider-ssh-authentication/README.md:7:In scope: supported physical devices and OS versions, approved test host, non-production test key references, approved fingerprint, successful Ed25519 and fallback coverage across the two platforms where supported, deliberate changed-key or alternate fixture rejection, user stop during bootstrap, redacted provider logs, and resource observations. Out of scope: full TCP or DNS forwarding matrix, App Store distribution, production credentials, trust UI, path switching, long rekey tests, and unrelated device logs.
