.task-board/EPIC-260715-3810we_tcp-dns-system-vpn/STORY-260715-1y04r0_shared-tunnel-runtime/TASK-260720-1qhxqa_bind-accepted-m0-runtime-revisions/README.md:7:In scope: accepted-resource identity and digest; reviewer verdict identity; generated target and dependency graph constraints; PacketFlowBridge, HEV/lwIP, MTU, buffer, batching, session, notice, and fork disposition bindings; selected SSH adapter, dependency pin, algorithm, window, rekey, lifecycle, notice, and maintenance bindings; compatibility check against the runtime contract; machine-readable and human-readable manifest; explicit productionCompositionPermitted result. Out of scope: re-running M0 matrices, selecting or tuning packet or SSH implementations, changing M0 decisions, coordinator implementation, TCP or DNS behavior, routes, UI, UDP, lanes, reconnect, and human ratification.
