.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-129-## 5. Concurrency and cancellation domains
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-130-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-131-1. The provider adapter actor serializes provider lifecycle and app-message
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-132-   reads. It never waits on app/UI liveness.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-133-2. The coordinator actor is the single writer of state, generation, acquisition
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:134:   stack, route-installed flag, and snapshot sequence.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-135-3. A generation owns one structured root task. SSH bootstrap, component prepare,
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:136:   route apply and read activation are awaited children. Long-running component
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-137-   work is owned by its session and joined by `stop`; no fire-and-forget task is
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-138-   permitted.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-139-4. `PacketFlowBridge` retains its existing actor supervisor and bounded child
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-140-   pumps. `NEPacketTunnelFlow` callbacks are bridged through a continuation with
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-141-   the existing late-callback tombstone; a late payload is not inspected.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:142:5. After post-settings activation, HEV runs on exactly one dedicated native
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-143-   thread under its process-wide lease. The bridge owns descriptor B and only
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:144:   lends it until HEV main returns. Pre-route packet-plane preflight owns no
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-145-   bridge descriptor, native thread, or HEV lease.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-146-6. The selected SSH adapter owns its event loop/executor. Observer events are
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-147-   copied into bounded typed values and sent asynchronously with the generation;
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-148-   the coordinator never executes engine code on its actor.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:149:7. TCP flow tasks belong to a bounded registry in `TCPConsumer`; DNS transaction
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:150:   tasks belong to `DNSConsumer`. Component stop closes admission, cancels and
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-151-   joins children, then returns.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-152-8. `stop` creates or joins one shielded cleanup task. Cleanup does not inherit
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-153-   caller cancellation. Repeated/concurrent stop calls await the same result.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-154-9. Cancellation is checked before and after every awaited acquisition. If stop
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-155-   wins after an operation returns, the returned resource is pushed then
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-156-   immediately rolled back; it is never published to the stopped generation.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-157-10. Every callback, completion and health event carries the generation. A stale
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-158-    event may update only bounded discard metrics; it cannot alter state,
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:159:    routes, snapshots, or a newer generation.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-160-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-161-## 6. Startup, usable publication, teardown and rollback
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-162-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-163-### 6.1 Successful M1 start
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-164-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-165-The order is binding:
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-166-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-167-1. Adapter accepts start only from idle, increments the generation and creates
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:168:   its root cancellation scope. Snapshot becomes `starting/configuration` with
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:169:   all capabilities false and `routesInstalled=false`.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:170:2. Decode the bounded configuration envelope; atomically load and validate one
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-171-   immutable non-secret snapshot and opaque secret/trust references. Confirm
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:172:   supported versions, M1 compatible route mode, and
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-173-   `productionCompositionPermitted` for a production root.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-174-3. Resolve/connect SSH on the physical path. Evaluate raw host-key evidence
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-175-   before credential retrieval/authentication. Authenticate and retain the
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:176:   verified identity plus actual IPv4/IPv6 endpoint. No routes exist.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-177-4. Construct the baseline single-session TCP consumer. It owns flow tasks but
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-178-   does not bind or own the HEV private admission boundary. No lanes exist.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:179:5. Prepare the DNS consumer and its logical `VirtualDNSIngress`; verify its
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-180-   upstream is SSH-only TCP. It must report ready without physical fallback.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-181-6. `M1PacketPlaneSession.prepare` performs a pure preflight of the bound
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:182:   packet/HEV configuration and constructs candidate-neutral references. It
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-183-   acquires no descriptor, HEV lease/thread or private listener and does not
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-184-   call `PacketBridge.start`.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:185:7. Build compatible-mode settings from the separately approved routing contract,
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:186:   bound M0 MTU, virtual addresses, tunnel DNS and the actual SSH endpoint host
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-187-   exclusion. Await `NetworkSettingsApplier.apply` completion.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:188:8. Mark `routesInstalled=true`; call `activateReads`. This is the only operation
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-189-   that may acquire the HEV/private-boundary resources and call the existing
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-190-   `PacketBridge.start`, which installs supervision and the first read chain.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-191-   Activation returns only after the first read registration and mandatory
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-192-   packet/HEV supervision are live. The packet-plane dispatcher owns private
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:193:   admission, sends CONNECT to TCP, sends only approved virtual-DNS UDP/TCP to
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:194:   DNS, and rejects other UDP. Activation does not require the first user packet.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:195:9. Re-check SSH, TCP, DNS and packet health, then atomically publish
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:196:   `usableTCPDNS` with `tcp=true`, `safeDNS=true`, `udp=false`,
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:197:   `routesInstalled=true`. Only this publication permits provider success.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-198-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-199-M1 opens no optional SSH lane. No UDP/full-capability probe participates in M1
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-200-base usability.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-201-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-202-### 6.2 Stop and mandatory runtime failure
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-203-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-204-The exact cleanup order is:
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-205-
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:206:1. Transition to `stopping`, close TCP/DNS admission, publish all capabilities
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-207-   false, and cancel the generation root.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-208-2. Stop/join packet reads, bridge pumps and HEV; `PacketFlow.shutdown` retires
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-209-   or tombstones the outstanding platform read. No new packets/HEV requests can
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-210-   reach consumers after this returns.
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:211:3. Only if settings were committed or their commit outcome is uncertain, clear
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md:212:   network settings and await the platform completion. If apply was never
.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-30zng6/TASK-260715-30zng6_runtime-contract.md-213-   called or definitively failed without commit, skip clear and preserve
